---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Case Studies"
description: "Illustrative examples of how Rhemroyal Services engagements are designed to help startups, growing businesses and social initiatives."
navActive: case
permalink: "case-studies.html"
---
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/index.html">Home</a><span>/</span>Case Studies</div>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">CASE STUDIES</span>
    <h1>How engagements like these typically play out.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Rhemroyal Services is a young consultancy, so the examples below are illustrative scenarios based on how our services are designed to work — not yet real client results. We'll replace them with real, named stories as soon as we have client permission to share them.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section white">
  <div class="container case-grid">
    {% for c in caseStudies.caseStudies %}
    <article class="case-card">
      <div class="case-card-content">
        {% if c.isIllustrative %}<span class="case-tag">ILLUSTRATIVE EXAMPLE</span>{% endif %}
        <h3>{{ c.title }}</h3>
        <p><strong>Situation:</strong> {{ c.situation }}</p>
        <p><strong>Approach:</strong> {{ c.approach }}</p>
        <p class="case-quote">"{{ c.quote }}"</p>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card-results">
        {% for r in c.results %}
        <div class="case-result"><b>{{ r.stat }}</b><span>{{ r.label }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <div><span class="eyebrow light">WANT TO BE OUR NEXT STORY?</span><h2>Let's talk about what your engagement could look like.</h2></div>
    <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact.html#book">Book a Consultation</a>
  </div>
</section>
